<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=felt">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Tools and materials</p><h1 class="enc-title">Felt</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1800 BCE</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century-bce">19th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Felt is a textile made by matting, condensing and pressing fibres, such as wool or animal fur, together. It is one of the oldest known textiles. Excavations at Çatal Hüyük in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a> show possible evidence of felting about 6000 BCE, and felt hats found in the Mongolian Autonomous Region of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> date to c. 1800 BCE. Siberian tombs of the 7th to 2nd century BCE show felt used for clothing, wall-hangings and horse blankets. Turkic and Mongol nomads used it for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yurt">yurts</a>, insulation and floor-coverings, and feltmaking is still practised in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-asia">Central Asia</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/felt.jpg" alt="Felt" width="330" height="247" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Bastet78 · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colored_felt_cloth.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>c. 1800 BCE</dd></div><div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Mongolian Autonomous Region, China</dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Note</span>Possible evidence of felting at Çatal Hüyük in Anatolia about 6000 BCE is not firm; the origin is said to have been most likely in east Asia.</p><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Built on</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/domestication">Domestication of animals<span>by 13,000 BCE</span></a></div><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Led to</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/yurt">Yurt<span>c. 500 BCE</span></a></div><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=felt">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
